=== Comptime Config Demo ===
max_connections : 128
worker_threads  : 4
timeout_seconds : 30
read_buffer_kb  : 8
enable_tls      : true

--- derived (const-folded) ---
pool            : 4 workers x 128 conns (tls=true)
total_buffer    : 1048576 bytes

--- lookup table (compile-time materialised) ---
well_known_ports: [22, 80, 443, 8080, 8443]
default_port    : 8080
find 443        : 443
find 9999       : -1
=== done ===
